				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35708118 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="35708118" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-498c9bce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="498c9bce" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why an Arabic beauty salon <span class="hl">needs its own marketing playbook</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-26c1c28b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="26c1c28b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-61f73749 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="61f73749" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3dc3b7ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3dc3b7ac" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>An Arabic beauty salon serves a client base with genuinely different search behaviour, booking channels and seasonal rhythms than a general salon — and marketing it in English only, on a Western calendar, leaves real demand undiscovered.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5bdfa05c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5bdfa05c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Half your discovery traffic searches in Arabic</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7991f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7991f0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Clients searching &#8220;صالون تجميل&#8221; or &#8220;صالون عروس&#8221; are a completely separate audience from English-language searchers, with different intent signals and different competitors ranking against them. A salon with no Arabic-language SEO presence is invisible to a large share of its actual local market.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5bc79daf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5bc79daf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The booking calendar follows Ramadan, Eid and wedding season — not January and June</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-47b88952 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="47b88952" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Demand for threading and henna spikes around Eid; bridal and engagement bookings cluster around the regional wedding calendar; family group bookings peak around holidays. A content and ad calendar built on generic Western seasonality misses every one of these windows.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15412351 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="15412351" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4d8b6295 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4d8b6295" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Arabic beauty salons, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Bilingual</b><span>— Arabic + English SEO and ad content both required</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">2x*</b><span>— booking surge in wedding &amp; Eid seasons</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">WhatsApp</b><span>— primary booking and referral channel</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">2-3 wks</b><span>— typical threading rebooking cycle</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
