					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1953" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1953"><p>Yes — demand for threading, henna and bridal packages moves with Ramadan, Eid and the regional wedding calendar, and our content and ad calendar is planned around those windows, not a generic Western schedule.</p></div>
				</div>
